# engine-strict is intentionally left OFF: pnpm's engine-strict enforces the
# engines range of every transitive dependency and fails the whole install on
# patch-level Node mismatches (e.g. a dep requiring 24.15.0 on a 24.14 host).
# The root package.json "engines" field documents our actual requirement
# (Node >= 24, pnpm >= 10); pnpm warns on mismatches without blocking installs.